SUMMARY:Boston: Alumni meet-up
DESCRIPTION:Attention U of T Engineering alumni in the Boston area! \n\n\nCatch up with fellow UofT alumni in Boston over Mediterranean bites and good conversation! \n\n\n\nCome say hello at this in-person meet up for UofT alumni in Boston – hosted by your local Global Alumni Ambassador Areeba Zakir. \nWhether you graduated recently or it’s been years since your days on campus\, come meet fellow alumni\, share stories\, expand your network and build connections with our U of T community in Boston. \n Date: Wednesday\, November 4\, 2026\n Time: 7:00 PM\n Location: Darna Mediterranean Seafood (https://darnamediterraneanseafood.com)(opens in new tab) \nWhat to expect: \n\n Delicious Mediterranean food\n Meeting fellow U of T alumni across industries and graduating years\n Catching up\, making new connections and growing our Boston alumni community\n\nCome solo or bring your U of T friends — everyone is welcome! \n\nQuestions? \nEmail Areeba Zakir \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDiscover your Global Alumni Ambassadors (GAA) around the world—visit our GAA site for more details!
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/boston-alumni-meet-up/
LOCATION:Darna Mediterranean Seafood
CATEGORIES:Alumni events
END:VEVENT
