SUMMARY:ECE Industry Day: Brookfield
DESCRIPTION:November 19 @ 12:00 pm – 2:00 pm \n\nRSVP for ECE Industry Day with Brookfield! \nExplore how engineering and technology contribute to Brookfield’s work across infrastructure\, energy and other industries. Hear directly from Brookfield representatives about their work\, emerging technologies and career pathways for electrical and computer engineers during an exclusive information session\, followed by a Q&A panel moderated by ECE Chair Professor Deepa Kundur. \nSpots are limited! Register by November 12 to secure your place at ECE Industry Day.
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/ece-industry-day-brookfield/
LOCATION:Galbraith Building\, Room 202 (GB202)\, 35 St George\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5S 1A4\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Info sessions,Lectures, seminars and workshops
END:VEVENT
