SUMMARY:U of T alumni at GameTime Social
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an exclusive alumni meet-up on November 20th at GameTime Social Mississauga. Located just on the border of Etobicoke\, the venue offers everything from classic arcade favourites to immersive sports games and more.  \nNetwork and reconnect with old and new friends in our dedicated alumni space for an evening of casual games\, great snacks and prizes!   \nLimited tickets available – get yours now!  \nUnlock your alumni perks:   \n\n 200 game credits on us\n Snacks and non-alcoholic drinks provided\n Unwind and network with fellow U of T alumni\n $65 value for just $20\n\n*Your ticket includes 200 game credits plus snacks and non-alcoholic drinks. Alcoholic beverages are available for purchase with valid ID. \n*U of T staff will be on site from 7 p.m. – 9 p.m. Once you have procured your game credits\, you are welcome to stay until the venue closes at 12 a.m. \nAbout GameTime Social\n25\,000+ square feet of dining and entertainment! Mississauga’s home to un-rushed social experiences and fresh-inspired food and drinks. Let the good times roll! Escape from the everyday distractions of life and just PLAY. We have endless entertainment for people of all ages to enjoy. \nVisit the GameTime Social website for more information.
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/u-of-t-alumni-at-gametime-social/
LOCATION:GameTime Social Mississauga
CATEGORIES:Socials
END:VEVENT
